cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LLM-zipper in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LLM-zipper: know before you compress"
abstract: >-
  An open-source framework for cheaper, faster, energy-efficient LLMs that predicts how much
  a model can be compressed, and at what quality cost, before compressing it.
authors:
  - name: "The LLM-zipper Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aidagroup/LLM-zipper"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/llm-zipper/"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - llm
  - compression
  - kv-cache
  - tensor-train
  - efficient-inference
